{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-02-13 14:24:00', 'title': "PG&E AND ANGEL ISLAND FERRY PARTNER TO LAUNCH CALIFORNIA'S FIRST ZERO-EMISSION, ELECTRIC SHORT-RUN FERRY", 'text': "OAKLAND, CALIF. , FEB. 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) IS PARTNERING WITH THE ANGEL ISLAND-TIBURON FERRY COMPANY (ANGEL ISLAND FERRY) TO SUPPORT THE ELECTRIFICATION OF THE ANGEL ISLAND VESSEL, WHICH PLANS TO OPERATE AS CALIFORNIA'S FIRST ZERO-EMISSION, ELECTRIC PROPULSION SHORT-ROUTE FERRY BEGINNING IN 2024."}